y.2005.05.014</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Casey</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gravance</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>RO</given-names></name><name><surname>Chabot</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>IK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Morphometric differences in sperm head dimensions of fertile and subfertile stallions</article-title><source>Theriogenology</source><year>1997</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>575</fpage><lpage>582</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16728009</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0093-691X(97)00015-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hirai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Boersma</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoeflich</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolf</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Foll</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Aum&#x000fc;ller</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Braun</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Objectively measured sperm motility and sperm head morphometry in boars (<italic>Sus scrofa</italic>): relation to fertility and seminal plasma growth factors</article-title><source>J Androl</source><year>2001</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>104</fpage><lpage>110</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11191073</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pe&#x000f1;a</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Saravia</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Garc&#x000ed;a-He