name><surname>Pe&#x000f1;a</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sperm indexes obtained using computer-assisted morphometry provide a forecast of the freezability of canine sperm</article-title><source>Int J Androl</source><year>2007</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>182</fpage><lpage>189</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17376220</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2605.2007.00743.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mohammed</surname><given-names>HO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Morphometry of stallion sperm by computer-assisted image analysis</article-title><source>Theriogenology</source><year>1995</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>367</fpage><lpage>377</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16727736</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0093-691X(95)00191-A</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hidalgo</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodr&#x000ed;guez</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorado</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Soler</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Morphometric classification of Spanish thoroughbred stallion sperm heads</article-title><source>Anim Reprod Sci</source><year>2008</year><volume>103</volume><fpage>374</fpage><lpage>378</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17628363</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.anireprosci.2007.06.001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sancho</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>P&#x000e9;rez-S&#x000e1;nchez</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Tabl